# Shared Office auth, Graph, substrate and Edge update/download hosts stay ordinary.
# Bing/Edge/Office features on shared hosts may need client-specific follow-up.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,copilot.microsoft.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,copilot.cloud.microsoft
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,copilot.com
